---

The analyses in this repository describe data published by others, and that
data is not covered by this licence:

  * malware traffic captures from malware-traffic-analysis.net (Brad Duncan)
  * Windows event recordings from the Security-Datasets project (OTRF)
  * Emerging Threats Open ruleset (Proofpoint), used unmodified
  * IP geolocation by DB-IP Lite (CC BY 4.0)
  * Certificate data from crt.sh (Sectigo)

Each is credited where it is used. No malicious sample, capture or binary is
included here; the analyses reference them by hash and by their original
source.
